              "value": "x(t)={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6t)\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(6t)\\end{aligned}]{e}^{6t}",
